# Build artefacts. The `agent` binary is built into a known output
# location by the Makefile (or into a container's `/.hpcc/agent`
# during image preparation), never committed. The Windows
# cross-build with `go build ./...` (no -o) drops `agent.exe`
# here; the Makefile target writes `hpcc-agent.exe`.
agent
agent.exe
hpcc-agent
hpcc-agent.exe
